  <section class="hero">
    <div class="container hero-grid">
      <div>
        <div class="eyebrow">Architectural Stabilization of LLMs</div>
        <h1>Designing for reliability, consistency, and interpretable behavior in large language models.</h1>
        <p>
          This site serves as a companion to my C Day poster and research presentation. It introduces the
          architectural stabilization of LLMs project, summarizes the experiment design, and provides direct access
          to the supporting CRAFT and reliability pipeline dashboards used to explore outcomes, trends, and model
          behavior.
        </p>
        <div class="hero-actions">
          <a class="btn btn-primary" href="#dashboards">View dashboard links</a>
          <a class="btn btn-secondary" href="#bio">About the researcher</a>
        </div>
