        <div class="hero-stat">
          <strong>Goal</strong>
          <span>Improve LLM dependability through architectural and experimental stabilization methods.</span>
        </div>
        <div class="hero-stat">
          <strong>Focus</strong>
          <span>Reliability, repeatability, response structure, and resilient system level behavior.</span>
        </div>
        <div class="hero-stat">
          <strong>Connected Work</strong>
          <span>CRAFT, reliability pipeline evaluation, Chrysalis, CIPHER, PRISM, and SAF.</span>
